   ],
   "links": [
    "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18#:~:text=I%20don%27t%20want%20to,there%20will%20be%20more."
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "A shaman opened the earth and trapped survivors in its crevices for Atarka to devour.",
