   ],
   "links": [
    "https://scryfall.com/card/dtk/156/seismic-rupture#:~:text=The%20shaman%20opened%20the,devour%20at%20her%20leisure."
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Surrak delivered the offering to Atarka there, and when his second told Atarka that Surrak had killed one of her brood, Surrak defeated the second.",
